          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<div class=\"boot-strap mt-5\">\n\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"card \">\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0558/7937/files/We_Build_a_Community.svg?v=1679499378\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"We Build a Community - A Sisterhood\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title onhover\">We Build a Community <br>- A Sisterhood</h5>\n                        <p class=\"card-title hover\">We believe in developing a strong sisterhood of people who empower, celebrate, and drive independence - of their own expectations, of history's expectations, and society's expectations. </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"card \">\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0558/7937/files/We_Are_Disruptors.svg?v=1679499375\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"We Are Disruptors\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title onhover\">We Are Disruptors</h5>\n                        <p class=\"card-title hover\">From our aspirational business model to the artistic discovery set inside each and every Rebel Nell piece, we set out to make progress for our people and our product.</p>  \n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"card \">\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0558/7937/files/We_Are_Intentional.svg?v=1679499375\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"We Are Intentional\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title onhover\">We Are Intentional</h5>\n                        <p class=\"card-title hover\">Each and every piece we create is founded in intention and belief. We believe greatly in the physical power of blending history and carrying it into the future both literally (with our jewelry) and systemically in our mission work. \n                        </p> \n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"card \">\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0558/7937/files/We_Have_Purpose.svg?v=1679499376\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"We Have Purpose\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title onhover\">We Have Purpose</h5>\n                        <p class=\"card-title hover\">Our purpose has depth and meaning. Beyond our jewelry, we aim to embolden all women to see their own worth. This purpose drives our interactions with those we employ through our mission and our customers through our service.\n                        </p>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n</div>",
            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
